28.63&#x000b1;1.60</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Gemcitabine &#x02192; fluvastatin</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6.09&#x000b1;0.11</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.19&#x000b1;0.04</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4.26&#x000b1;0.07</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">17.07&#x000b1;0.27</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">6.67&#x000b1;0.13</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">34.41&#x000b1;0.51</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote2"><label/><p>Arrows indicate the sequence of treatment.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>